<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->The kiiro scouts from [kiiro_settlement_label] have recently been discovering traces left by thrumbo in the wild. After careful investigation, they have finally confirmed that a thrumbo herd has migrated near [kiiro_settlement_label].\n\nConsidering that you might be interested in these big guys, they have decided to share this information with you. The location of this thrumbo herd has now been marked on your map.\n\n"They may not stay in one place for too long. If you decide to go, it's best to be sooner."</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_ThrumboFound.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[kiiro_settlement_label]所屬的斥候最近頻繁在野外發現敲擊獸留下的痕跡，經過仔細的搜查，終於確定了近期有一群敲擊獸遷徙到了[kiiro_settlement_label]附近。\n\n考慮到你可能對這些大傢伙感興趣，她們決定把這個訊息分享給你。這群敲擊獸的位置現在被標註在你的地圖上了。\n\n「它們可能不會在原地停留太久。決定要去的話，最好早些動身吧。」</li>
  </Kiiro_ThrumboFound.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->thrumbo found</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_ThrumboFound.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->敲擊獸遷徙</li>
  </Kiiro_ThrumboFound.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: thrumbo join -->
  <Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-2.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>敲擊獸加入</Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-2.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: These thrumbo surprisingly turned out to be very friendly towards us. They slowly approached our caravan after seeing us... and then joined us! Now, these massive and furry creatures are our new friends. -->
  <Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-2.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>這群敲擊獸意外地很親近人，它們在看見我們的遠行隊后就慢慢靠近了過來......然後加入了我們！現在這群巨大的毛茸茸是我們的好朋友了。</Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-2.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任務過期：[resolvedQuestName]</Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Seems that the thrumbo herd near [kiiro_settlement_label] has migrated elsewhere. -->
  <Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>[kiiro_settlement_label]附近的敲擊獸群似乎已經遷徙向別處了。</Kiiro_ThrumboFound.root.nodes.QuestEndUnfinished.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>